West Edge in an ongoing Economic Development Project which encompasses the area west of downtown and north of the Railroad.  This area is
underutilized and has a symbiotic relationship with downtown goals.  Key components of the project on the public side include 15th Street
Wetlands "aka pump house park", Civic Center Commons and the Reed Rail Spur.  The first Phase of the Wetlands and Civic Center Commons are
substantially funded and underway
