house.  The $3.5 million dollar identified in the line item is the cost estimate for Phase II of the wetlands.  Fully renovating the pumphouse
building is expected to be $1.5 to $2.0 million.  With the ongoing private sector (Steam Plant, Warehouse 21) activity along the rail spur is
possible and perhaps likely that the rail spur will elevate in priority.  Leveraging available funds with grant opportunities has been a hallmark of
the West Edge project is expected to continue.
